/* SFGAO_VALIDATE
 * row: SFGAO_VALIDATE (0x01000000) Validate cached information. The shell confirms that the objects specified in apidl still exist and does not use cached information when retrieving the attributes. If one or more of the items specified in apidl no longer exist, this method returns an error code. If cidl is zero, the shell discards all cached information for the shell folder. This is similar to doing a refresh of the folder.
